 most likely to pinch your ankles.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— In-game racial description</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About_crabs\">About crabs</span></h2>\n<p>Crabs are crustaceans found around <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>. Only two crabs are known inside the game, both found dead at the <a href=\"/wiki/Grey_Harbour_Docks\" title=\"Grey Harbour Docks\">Grey Harbour Docks</a>. There are variants of the normal crab in-game via summoning though (see crab characters bellow).\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Racial_features\">Racial features</span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Speed Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Speed_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Creature_Speed_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Base Racial Speed</dt>\n<dd>9m / 30ft</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/38px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Creature Size Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png/25px-Creature_Size_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Creature_Size_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Size</dt>\n<dd>Small</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Crab_characters\">Crab characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armoured_Crab\" title=\"Armoured Crab\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png/30px-Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png/45px-Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png/60px-Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Armoured Crab\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png/30px-Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Portrait_Armoured_Crab.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armoured_Crab\" title=\"Armoured Crab\">Armoured Crab</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjured_Crab\" title=\"Conjured Crab\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png/30px-Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png/45px-Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png/60px-Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjured Crab\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png/30px-Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Conjured_Crab.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjured_Crab\" 